	(text "V1 ramps up in 1 ms like a bench supply being switched on. The divider is R1||R2 = 5k into C1 = 100u, so VGND then takes about 2.5 s to settle -- that is why the run is 3 s long."
		(at 12.7 71.12 0)
		(effects
